{"unit_id": "tag:01V9:proof", "translation": "注意，若<MATH_0001>在<MATH_0002>处是光滑的（smooth），则由引理<REF_0001>可知（5）成立，而（6）是（5）的略弱形式。此外，<MATH_0003>光滑（smooth）蕴含环映射（ring map）<MATH_0004>是平坦的（flat）（见引理<REF_0002>），且<MATH_0005>是秩（rank）等于<MATH_0006>的有限局部自由（finite locally free）对象（见引理<REF_0003>）。因此，（1）蕴含（3）和（4）。由引理<REF_0004>还可知（1）蕴含（2）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由引理<REF_0005>，微分（differentials）模（module）<MATH_0007>（取自纤维（fibre）<MATH_0008>相对于<MATH_0009>）是微分（differentials）模（module）<MATH_0010>（取自<MATH_0011>相对于<MATH_0012>）的拉回（pullback）。这就给出了该引理第（4）项所列的等式（equality）。由引理<REF_0006>，这些模（modules）是有限型的（finite type）。因此，由中山引理（Nakayama's Lemma）可知，模（modules）<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>各自所需的生成元（generators）的最少个数相同，且等于这个<MATH_0015>-向量空间（vector space）的维数（dimension）（代数（Algebra）章，引理<REF_0007>）。这特别表明（3）和（4）等价（equivalent）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n代数（Algebra）章的引理<REF_0008>表明（2）蕴含（1）。代数（Algebra）章的引理<REF_0009>表明（3）和（4）蕴含（2）。最后，（6）蕴含（5），例如见代数（Algebra）章的例<REF_0010>；由代数（Algebra）章的引理<REF_0011>可知（5）蕴含（1）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "rank", "target_term": "秩"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "equality", "target_term": "等式"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型的"}, {"source_term": "Nakayama's Lemma", "target_term": "中山引理"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "generators", "target_term": "生成元"}, {"source_term": "vector space", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {