{"unit_id": "tag:02V4:statement", "translation": "设\n<MATH_0001>\n为概形（schemes）的笛卡尔（cartesian）图表（diagram）。设<MATH_0002>、<SPACE_0001><MATH_0003>分别为<MATH_0004>、<SPACE_0002><MATH_0005>光滑（smooth）处各点（points）所成的开子概形（open subscheme）。\n若下列任一条件成立，则有<MATH_0006>：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0007>是平坦的（flat）且是局部有限表示的（locally of finite presentation），或\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0008>是局部有限表示的（locally of finite presentation）且<MATH_0009>是平坦的（flat）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "图表中的对象"}, {"source_term": "cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔", "context": "所给图表满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "引理的初始数据"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "定义两个开子概形的逐点性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "构成两个开子概形的点"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "由相应的光滑点确定的子概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的", "context": "第一个充分条件的前一性质"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的", "context": "第一个充分条件的后一性质"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的", "context": "第二个充分条件对第一个对象的要求"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦的", "context": "第二个充分条件对第二个对象的要求"}], "notes": []}
